<devicesets>
<deviceset name="WE-SUKW" urn="urn:adsk.eagle:component:14283198/3" prefix="FB">
<description>WE-SUKW SMT EMI Suppression 5-Hole Ferrite Bead
Wired SMT Ferrite with Different Number of Turns

Characteristics
Suitable for applications with high currents up to 9 A
Low RDC
Impedance up to 580 Ω
SMT version
Special NiSn pad for improved soldering results
AEC-Q200 qualified
Operating temperature: –55 °C to +125 °C

Applications
Protection against radio frequency interferences of components on PCB’s

Details see: www.we-online.com/components/products/WE-SUKW

Updated by Ella 2026-09-17
202 (C) Würth Elektronik</description>
